    path: "flaui/Notepad.Tests/NotepadTestBase.cs",
    codeLanguage: "csharp",
    code: "[SetUp]\npublic void BaseSetUp()\n{\n    _automation = new UIA3Automation();\n    _tempFilePath = Path.Combine(\n        Path.GetTempPath(),\n        $\"{TempFilePrefix}{Guid.NewGuid():N}.txt\");\n    File.WriteAllText(_tempFilePath, InitialText);\n\n    Process.Start(new ProcessStartInfo\n    {\n        FileName = \"notepad.exe\",\n        Arguments = $\"\\\"{_tempFilePath}\\\"\",\n        UseShellExecute = true\n    })?.Dispose();\n\n    var expectedFileName = Path.GetFileName(_tempFilePath);\n    var windowResult = Retry.WhileNull(\n        () => FindNotepadWindow(_automation, expectedFileName),\n        timeout: TimeSpan.FromSeconds(15),\n        interval: TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(250),\n        ignoreException: true);\n\n    _window = windowResult.Result;\n    _notepadProcessId = _window.Properties.ProcessId.Value;\n}",
    what: "Before each NUnit test, the base class creates a UIA3 automation client, generates a GUID-based temporary filename, writes initial content, launches Notepad, then uses FlaUI's retry helper to locate the window containing that filename. The discovered window and process ID are stored in instance fields for the scenario and later teardown.",
    whatUk: "Перед кожним NUnit test base class створює UIA3 automation client, генерує GUID-based temporary filename, записує initial content, запускає Notepad, а потім через FlaUI retry helper знаходить window з цим filename. Discovered window і process ID зберігаються в instance fields для scenario і teardown.",
    why: "This is the C# equivalent of fixture setup: scenario tests inherit a prepared, isolated Notepad document without duplicating lifecycle mechanics.",
    whyUk: "Це C# еквівалент fixture setup: scenario tests успадковують prepared, isolated Notepad document без дублювання lifecycle mechanics.",
    state: "Before `[SetUp]`: no UIA client or test file. After: the base object owns UI automation, a unique file, a discovered Notepad window and its current process ID.",
    stateUk: "До `[SetUp]`: немає UIA client або test file. Після: base object володіє UI automation, unique file, discovered Notepad window і його current process ID.",
