    summary: "Separate scenario intent from reusable desktop-automation infrastructure.",
    summaryUk: "Відокремте scenario intent від reusable desktop-automation infrastructure.",
    path: "flaui/Notepad.Tests/NotepadTests.cs",
    codeLanguage: "csharp",
    code: "[Test]\n[Category(\"PortableNotepad\")]\npublic void CanTypeAndSaveText()\n{\n    const string expected = \"Hello desktop automation\";\n\n    var editor = FindEditor();\n    ReplaceTextWithClipboard(editor, expected);\n    CaptureWindow(\"01-text-entered\");\n\n    Assert.That(ReadEditorText(editor), Is.EqualTo(expected));\n\n    SaveAndWaitForText(expected);\n    CaptureWindow(\"02-saved\");\n\n    Assert.That(File.ReadAllText(TestFilePath), Is.EqualTo(expected));\n}",
    what: "NUnit calls inherited setup before entering this method. The scenario asks the base class for the editor, replaces text through the shared clipboard strategy, records evidence and checks the UI value. It then performs the shared save-and-wait action and independently verifies disk contents. Inherited teardown runs after the method.",
    whatUk: "NUnit викликає inherited setup до входу в цей method. Scenario просить base class знайти editor, замінює text через shared clipboard strategy, записує evidence і перевіряє UI value. Потім виконує shared save-and-wait action та незалежно перевіряє disk contents. Inherited teardown запускається після method.",
    why: "The test method reads as business/test intent because low-level UI discovery, timing, clipboard STA handling, screenshots and cleanup are centralized. This is the practical purpose of a test base/framework abstraction.",
    whyUk: "Test method читається як business/test intent, бо low-level UI discovery, timing, clipboard STA handling, screenshots і cleanup централізовані. Це практичний сенс test base/framework abstraction.",
    state: "Before method: setup prepared an empty unique document. After method: exact text has been validated in the editor and on disk; teardown then removes the owned resources.",
    stateUk: "До method: setup підготував empty unique document. Після method: exact text перевірений в editor і на disk; teardown потім видаляє owned resources.",
    breakage: "Inlining every helper here would duplicate complex mechanics across scenarios and make behavior harder to change consistently.",
    breakageUk: "Inline всіх helpers сюди продублює complex mechanics між scenarios і ускладнить consistent change behavior.",
    keyPoints: ["Tests express intent; framework helpers express mechanics.", "The assertions remain visible in the scenario."],
    keyPointsUk: ["Tests виражають intent; framework helpers — mechanics.", "Assertions залишаються видимими у scenario."],
    pitfalls: ["Hiding all assertions inside helpers until the test no longer communicates what it proves."],
